---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Cookie policy — Vitachy"
  description="Vitachy does not use tracking, advertising or analytics cookies. Only strictly necessary technical cookies."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 pt-10 md:pt-14 pb-20">
    <h1 class="display text-3xl md:text-[2.25rem] font-bold leading-tight mb-2">Cookie policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft mb-10">Last updated: 07/06/2026</p>

    <p class="leading-[1.65] text-ink-soft mb-4">
      Short version: <strong>this site does not use tracking, advertising or analytics cookies</strong>. We won't ask you to accept any banner because there is nothing to accept.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display text-xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-3">Cookies that may appear</h2>
    <p class="leading-[1.65] text-ink-soft mb-4">
      Browsing vitachy.com may only set <strong>strictly necessary technical cookies</strong>, exempt from consent under Article 22.2 of the Spanish LSSI-CE and AEPD's criteria:
    </p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
      <table class="w-full text-sm border border-line">
        <thead class="bg-paper-warm">
          <tr>
            <th class="text-left p-3 border-b border-line font-semibold">Origin</th>
            <th class="text-left p-3 border-b border-line font-semibold">Purpose</th>
            <th class="text-left p-3 border-b border-line font-semibold">Type</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3 align-top text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Cloudflare (site infrastructure)</td>
            <td class="p-3 align-top text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Security and delivery performance (e.g. <code>__cf_bm</code>, bot protection)</td>
            <td class="p-3 align-top text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Technical, session</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3 align-top text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Cloudflare Turnstile (only on the contact page)</td>
            <td class="p-3 align-top text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Verify that the form submission is from a human, not an automated bot</td>
            <td class="p-3 align-top text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Technical, session</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="leading-[1.65] text-ink-soft mb-4">
      These cookies do not personally identify you, do not track your browsing on other sites and expire quickly.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display text-xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-3">Third-party cookies</h2>
    <p class="leading-[1.65] text-ink-soft mb-4">
      "Buy on Amazon" buttons are links: when clicked, you leave this site for Amazon, where Amazon's own cookie policy applies. While browsing vitachy.com, Amazon does not set cookies on your browser.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display text-xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-3">Managing cookies</h2>
    <p class="leading-[1.65] text-ink-soft mb-4">
      You can configure your browser to block or delete cookies at any time (see Chrome, Firefox, Safari or Edge help). Blocking technical cookies may prevent the contact form from working.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display text-xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="leading-[1.65] text-ink-soft mb-4">
      If in the future we add cookies that require consent (e.g. analytics), we will update this policy and request prior authorisation where appropriate.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
